    "text": "From a circular disc of radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> and mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>M</mi></math>, a small disc of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is removed from the disc. The moment of inertia of the remaining disc about an axis perpendicular to the plane of the disc and passing through <math><mi>O</mi></math> is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-08-20_at_2.42.09_PM.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 209px;\" />",
